# joints.pdl - the TUNABLE joints of the Eden agent seat (spec section 0 JOINT rows). Bounds, step and autonomy only: the LIVE value of each lives in
# weights.pdl (one home per fact). Tune with  &.widgits/concept-bank/ops/+x/joint_tune.+x  so every move is bounded and leaves a TUNE row in tuning_ledger.txt.
# autonomy=0: only a person (proposer=human) moves it. A model may PROPOSE (a CAND row in a review file); it never applies. Raise autonomy only after a joint has
# a track record (grade = (reward+1)/(reward+punish+2) over its Watch/FEEDBACK rows).
# JOINT | id | area | key | value | step | min | max | autonomy | owner_seat | note
JOINT | j_plant | eden | w_plant | @weights.pdl | step=1 | min=0 | max=20 | autonomy=0 | owner_seat=1 | note="weight of the plant act"
JOINT | j_water | eden | w_water | @weights.pdl | step=1 | min=0 | max=20 | autonomy=0 | owner_seat=1 | note="weight of the water act"
JOINT | j_collect | eden | w_collect | @weights.pdl | step=1 | min=0 | max=20 | autonomy=0 | owner_seat=1 | note="weight of the collect act"
JOINT | j_eat | eden | w_eat | @weights.pdl | step=1 | min=0 | max=20 | autonomy=0 | owner_seat=1 | note="weight of the eat act"
